Do not require paid APIs, external AI services, user accounts, or a backend to play the game.

The game must run after dependencies are installed and the documented development command is executed.

Use a sensible logical resolution around 960 × 540 or 1280 × 720, with responsive scaling and proper aspect-ratio preservation.

Do not stretch character sprites or distort background artwork to fit arbitrary screen dimensions.

